            "Save any section or page from the editor: open the block\u2019s \u22ee menu and choose \u201cSave to cloud library\u201d. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.": [
                "D\u00fczenleyiciden herhangi bir b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc veya sayfay\u0131 kaydedin: blo\u011fun \u22ee men\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131n ve \u201cBulut k\u00fct\u00fcphanesine kaydet\u201di se\u00e7in. D\u00fczenleyicideki Bulut k\u00fct\u00fcphanesi panelinden kaydedilmi\u015f tasar\u0131mlar\u0131 sitelerinizin herhangi birine ekleyin."
