            "Delete it": [
                "Bunu silin"
            ],
            "In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example \u201cmy-pbs-library\u201d). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.": [
                "Cloudflare kontrol panelinizde R2 Object Storage b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131n ve bir bucket olu\u015fturun (\u00f6rne\u011fin \u201cmy-pbs-library\u201d). Gizli tutun: genel bir alan ad\u0131 ba\u011flamay\u0131n."
            ],
            "Open \u201cManage API tokens\u201d in R2 and create an API token with \u201cObject Read & Write\u201d permission, limited to that one bucket.": [
                "R2 i\u00e7inde \u201cAPI belirte\u00e7lerini y\u00f6net\u201d b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131n ve yaln\u0131zca bu paketle s\u0131n\u0131rland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f \u201cNesne Okuma ve Yazma\u201d iznine sahip bir API belirteci olu\u015fturun."
            ],
            "Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).": [
                "G\u00f6sterilen Eri\u015fim Anahtar\u0131 Kimli\u011fini ve Gizli Eri\u015fim Anahtar\u0131n\u0131 kopyalay\u0131n (gizli anahtar yaln\u0131zca bir kez g\u00f6sterilir)."
            ],
            "Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https:\/\/<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is \u201cauto\u201d.": [
                "Hesab\u0131n\u0131z i\u00e7in S3 u\u00e7 noktas\u0131n\u0131 kopyalay\u0131n. \u015euna benzer: https:\/\/<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. B\u00f6lge \u201cauto\u201d de\u011ferindedir."
            ],
            "Paste the values below, save, then press \u201cTest connection\u201d. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.": [
                "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki de\u011ferleri yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n, kaydedin ve ard\u0131ndan \"Ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 s\u0131na\" d\u00fc\u011fmesine bas\u0131n. Kitapl\u0131\u011f\u0131 yaln\u0131zca test ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 oldu\u011funda kendi depolama alan\u0131n\u0131za ge\u00e7irin."
            ],
            "Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).": [
                "Sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131n\u0131zla (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO veya S3 ile uyumlu herhangi bir hizmet) \u00f6zel bir paket (bucket) olu\u015fturun."
            ],
            "Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.": [
                "Yaln\u0131zca bu demetteki nesneleri okuyabilen, yazabilen ve silebilen bir eri\u015fim anahtar\u0131 olu\u015fturun."
            ],
            "Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket\u2019s region.": [
                "S3 u\u00e7 noktas\u0131n\u0131 (Amazon S3 i\u00e7in: %s) ve paketin b\u00f6lgesini bulun."
            ],
            "Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off \u201cPath-style addresses\u201d. Most other services use path-style.": [
                "Amazon S3 sanal olarak bar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131lan adresleri kullan\u0131r: \u201cPath-style addresses\u201d se\u00e7ene\u011fini kapat\u0131n. Di\u011fer hizmetlerin \u00e7o\u011fu yol stilini kullan\u0131r."
            ],
            "Paste the values below, save, then press \u201cTest connection\u201d.": [
                "De\u011ferleri a\u015fa\u011f\u0131ya yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n, kaydedin, ard\u0131ndan \u201cBa\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 test et\u201d se\u00e7ene\u011fine bas\u0131n."
            ],
            "Storage settings saved.": [
                "Depolama ayarlar\u0131 kaydedildi."
            ],
            "Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital\u00ae storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital\u00ae quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital\u00ae storage.": [
                "Bulut k\u00fct\u00fcphaneniz, plan\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n i\u00e7erdi\u011fi alanla birlikte Zinn Digital\u00ae depolama alan\u0131nda tutulur. Bunun yerine k\u00fct\u00fcphanenizi kendi Cloudflare R2 veya S3 uyumlu paketinizde de tutabilirsiniz: bu durumda hi\u00e7bir Zinn Digital\u00ae kotas\u0131 uygulanmaz ve ayn\u0131 pakete ba\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z her site k\u00fct\u00fcphaneyi payla\u015f\u0131r. Tak\u0131m k\u00fct\u00fcphaneleri her zaman Zinn Digital\u00ae depolama alan\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131r."
